{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13210140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13210140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321014001:1":{"text":"奇花！你没事吧？","source_cn":"奇花！你没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75255478A9E55A75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321014002:1":{"text":"没、没事……对不起，让各位担心了……","source_cn":"没、没事……对不起，让各位担心了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10F56BA029D6FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321014003:1":{"text":"没出事就好……","source_cn":"没出事就好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x269A3098C6026422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321014004:1":{"text":"这么看来，茶壶先生还是很关心奇花的嘛！我们一路上追过来，就数茶壶先生跑得最快了！","source_cn":"这么看来，茶壶先生还是很关心奇花的嘛！我们一路上追过来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEB009011C9AF8BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321014005:1":{"text":"是啊，茶壶先生跑得脸都红了，好像连脑袋里的茶都重新热起来了呢~","source_cn":"是啊，茶壶先生跑得脸都红了，好像连脑袋里的茶都重新热起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B28ADE77B2FD31E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321014006:1":{"text":"谢谢您，茶壶先生……","source_cn":"谢谢您，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30BB3FFD2D754697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321014007:1":{"text":"唉，你谢我做什么……应该我向你道歉才对。","source_cn":"唉，你谢我做什么……应该我向你道歉才对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7BB5F78A48B34832","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321014008:1":{"text":"对不起，刚才我不该那样训斥你。毕竟保存茶叶是我的职责，茶叶变苦应该由我负责，和负责采摘的你无关。","source_cn":"对不起，刚才我不该那样训斥你。毕竟保存茶叶是我的职责，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13EF4EA89998347B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321014009:1":{"text":"不是的，茶壶先生……那不是你的错。","source_cn":"不是的，茶壶先生……那不是你的错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CDADAA81A531AD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321014010:1":{"text":"我刚刚才想起来，前几天新摘的那些花瓣，还没来得及蜜渍……","source_cn":"我刚刚才想起来，前几天新摘的那些花瓣，还没来得及蜜渍……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C251F15E82B5C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321014011:1":{"text":"蜜渍？","source_cn":"蜜渍？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39E0ABF4476E894","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321014012:1":{"text":"是的。只有经过蜜渍的花瓣才能作为茶叶……既能保留花香，又能去除苦涩的味道。","source_cn":"是的。只有经过蜜渍的花瓣才能作为茶叶……既能保留花香，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0F93AC8453FF840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321014013:1":{"text":"我、我刚刚才想起来……对不起，都是我的错……","source_cn":"我、我刚刚才想起来……对不起，都是我的错……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15140E2D09F1372D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321014014:1":{"text":"原来是这样！难怪前两壶茶喝起来会是苦的！","source_cn":"原来是这样！难怪前两壶茶喝起来会是苦的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA614AFA72C4CB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321014015:1":{"text":"可是，我从没做过这样的事！为什么以前的花瓣茶叶没有苦味？","source_cn":"可是，我从没做过这样的事！为什么以前的花瓣茶叶没有苦味？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28DAA3B2C5E25F06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321014016:1":{"text":"我……每次采回花瓣之后，都会将它们浸泡起来，第二天早上再放到罐子里。","source_cn":"我……每次采回花瓣之后，都会将它们浸泡起来，第二天早上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x617D28A1AC63B85F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321014017:1":{"text":"但是前几天，我刚回到庄园，子爵先生就说有一支颜料不见了，让我去找。再后来，我就忘记了这件事……","source_cn":"但是前几天，我刚回到庄园，子爵先生就说有一支颜料不见了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB623C88404F59078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321014018:1":{"text":"……你每次都会做这件事？","source_cn":"……你每次都会做这件事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FAFCC30B471F76B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321014019:1":{"text":"嗯，我只忘过这一次！抱歉，茶壶先生……","source_cn":"嗯，我只忘过这一次！抱歉，茶壶先生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CC87E0EF4B6AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321014020:1":{"text":"看来奇花默默做了很多工作呢。","source_cn":"看来奇花默默做了很多工作呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCCE3BFB67999A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321014021:1":{"text":"难怪……我终于理解子爵先生为什么会选中你了。","source_cn":"难怪……我终于理解子爵先生为什么会选中你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE521DA65E98B400E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1321014022: